nd writing performance\n- Hashing of item stacks is now only done once per pipeline instead of once per protocol transition\n- Improved caching of data held by specific chunks\n- Minor improvements to NBT tag reading and writing\n\n\n**Compatibility & Fixes**\n- Fixed advance_weather=false in version **26.1.x.**\n\n**Translation contributors**\nA list of all translators can be found here: [https://crowdin.com/project/viafabricplus/activity-stream](https://crowdin.com/project/viafabricplus/activity-stream)\n\nPlease also read the [4.4.12 Changelogs](https://github.com/ViaVersion/ViaFabricPlus/releases/tag/4.4.12).\n\nYour support means a lot! If you'd like to help keep the project going, consider donating at [https://florianreuth.de/donate](https://florianreuth.de/donate). I’ll continue improving this project to the best of my ability.","changelog_url":null,"date_published":"2026-05-09T20:32:11.282123Z","downloads":5609,"version_type":"release","status":"listed","requested_status":null,"files":[{"id":"oyXNMIZk","hashes":{"sha512":"13005f1d3b363f3bd5a765f7c866ff7f095864f1e104f3d45da0f6d022310992a29f2f517732d1421cb5dd29e7c3ccf5632e8deae018949564ba66deb8394d2e","sha1":"fbb1d7d76ae9f9586b503d9882d45a6327aa875e"},"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/rIC2XJV4/versions/D3bMMycq/ViaFabricPlus-4.4.13.jar","filename":"ViaFabricPlus-4.4.13.jar","primary":true,"size":26904337,"file_type":null}],"dependencies":[]},"b009a07ecbdf3eb510b4acacbb435e058406ddbabcc4f1a5efeacad154cd26777474dcf4a2b5a3a92644b150f047977ada5687a9d9172132fbe6d3d036961b7e":{"game_versions":["1.21.11"],"loaders":["fabric"],"id":"fDpuVzVr","project_id":"YL57xq9U","author_id":"DzLrfrbK","featured":false,"name":"Iris 1.10.7 for Fabric 1.21.11","version_number":"1.10.7+1.21.11-fabric","changelog":"Fixed a bunch of bugs","changelog_url":null,"date_published":"2026-03-24T17:04:26.898144Z","downloads":2276986,"version_type":"release","status":"listed","requested_status":null,"files":[{"id":"NKRXHcAK","hashes":{"sha1":